# Text this repository compares byte for byte must keep one shape in every
# working tree. `sdk/core/tests/test_core.cpp` asserts that the SDK serializes
# a runtime to exactly the committed document, and a CRLF checkout would break
# that comparison on Windows without changing anything real.
sdk/core/tests/data/*.json text eol=lf

# fixtures/README.md publishes this fixture's digest, and a CRLF checkout would
# change it without changing anything real.
fixtures/malformed.usda text eol=lf
